{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Motel Simulator : Create, Renovate & Grow Business",
    "steam_appid": 2536970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/c4207307f2beb30e3aba2888115c8a1e.avif?t=1714757809\" /></span><br>In this game, you will become the manager of a motel, and your task will be to create, renovate, and grow your business to attract numerous guests.<br>Design the interiors of your motel. Choose styles, color schemes, and decorations to create a unique atmosphere in each room and common areas. Bring your creative ideas to life to attract and impress guests.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Apply your entrepreneurial skills to develop your motel into a profitable business. Set room prices, control expenses, and optimize your revenues. Attract guests through marketing campaigns and provide top-notch service.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swift success will lead to increased demand for rooms. Consider expanding the building, adding new floors, or constructing additional facilities like restaurants or spa centers to attract even more customers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/ebd33fb146294f7ae80ab472c462abdd.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/ebd33fb146294f7ae80ab472c462abdd.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/ebd33fb146294f7ae80ab472c462abdd.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pay attention to every visitor, from families and tourists to business travelers \u2013 each guest will have their own preferences and requirements. Fulfill their requests and offer various services to keep your hotel successful and popular.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/059d78a387a2841dafafb68a2afc42fe.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/059d78a387a2841dafafb68a2afc42fe.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/059d78a387a2841dafafb68a2afc42fe.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Be a wise financial manager and monitor the hotel's budget. Make decisions to maximize profits, invest in expansion or improvements, and be prepared for economic challenges that may arise during your business's growth.<br>Compete with other motels in the area and become the most attractive choice for guests. Evolve, listen to feedback, and compare your success with competitors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/29469fa178653133d8678155179ed60e.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/29469fa178653133d8678155179ed60e.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/29469fa178653133d8678155179ed60e.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Motel Simulator: Create, Renovate &amp; Grow Business offers you the opportunity to become a professional in hotel management. Create, improve, and thrive to establish the most sought-after and impressive motel in the region!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/13362364fff939f1f2d7a1b97bc267f3.avif?t=1714757809\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/c4207307f2beb30e3aba2888115c8a1e.avif?t=1714757809\" /></span><br>In this game, you will become the manager of a motel, and your task will be to create, renovate, and grow your business to attract numerous guests.<br>Design the interiors of your motel. Choose styles, color schemes, and decorations to create a unique atmosphere in each room and common areas. Bring your creative ideas to life to attract and impress guests.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/9c5513004596808228ea7876f285e767.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Apply your entrepreneurial skills to develop your motel into a profitable business. Set room prices, control expenses, and optimize your revenues. Attract guests through marketing campaigns and provide top-notch service.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.poster.avif?t=1714757809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.webm?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536970/extras/31e182d4674cfe012fc347b17f03d251.mp4?t=1714757809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v